OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd light shower at first,
OL,6,Fotherwise a mainly dry but cloudy
OL,7,Fmorning. Rain will spread across from
OL,8,Fthe west through the afternoon,
OL,9,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,10,Fheavier later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain will be widespread and
OL,13,Fheavy at times this evening, clearing
OL,14,Feast overnight with just a few light
OL,15,Fshowers following.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA bright but rather breezy
OL,18,Fday with a few sunny spells between
OL,19,Fscattered showers. Feeling rather
OL,20,Fchilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
